<view class="trends-page {{uiThemeClass}}">
  <view class="trends-heading"><image src="/assets/mascot/success-1.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view><text class="trends-title">变化藏在每一天</text><text class="trends-sub">坚持记录，找到自己的饮食节奏。</text></view></view>
  <view class="calendar-card"><view class="month-heading"><view class="month-arrow" data-step="-1" bindtap="handleMonth">‹</view><text>{{calendar.label}}</text><view class="month-arrow {{calendar.canNext ? '' : 'month-disabled'}}" data-step="1" bindtap="handleMonth">›</view><view class="back-today" bindtap="handleToday">今天</view></view><view class="calendar-week"><text wx:for="{{weekdays}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><view class="calendar-grid"><view wx:for="{{calendar.cells}}" wx:key="key" class="calendar-cell {{item.blank ? 'cell-blank' : ''}} {{item.future ? 'cell-future' : ''}}" data-date="{{item.blank || item.future ? '' : item.key}}" bindtap="handleDay"><view class="calendar-date date-{{item.tone}} {{item.selected ? 'date-selected' : ''}}"><text>{{item.day}}</text><view wx:if="{{item.today}}" class="today-dot"></view></view></view></view><view class="calendar-legend"><view><text class="legend-dot none"></text>未记录</view><view><text class="legend-dot some"></text>有记录</view><view><text class="legend-dot three"></text>三餐均有记录</view></view></view>
  <view class="data-heading"><text>数据趋势</text><text class="range-caption">截至 {{selectedDate}}</text></view><view class="trends-tabs"><view class="{{rangeDays === 7 ? 'tab-selected' : ''}}" data-days="7" bindtap="handleRangeChange">近 7 天</view><view class="{{rangeDays === 30 ? 'tab-selected' : ''}}" data-days="30" bindtap="handleRangeChange">近 30 天</view></view>
  <view class="trend-state" wx:if="{{viewState === 'loading'}}">正在整理记录…</view><view class="trend-state" wx:elif="{{viewState === 'error'}}">{{errorMessage}}</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="dashboard-summary"><view><text class="summary-label">已记录日期的日均摄入</text><view><text class="summary-number">{{overview.average}}</text><text class="summary-unit"> {{overview.unit}}</text></view><text class="summary-note">当前目标 {{overview.goal}}</text></view><view class="coverage"><text>记录覆盖</text><view><text>{{trend.recordedDays}}</text> / {{rangeDays}} 天</view></view></view>
    <view class="dashboard-card"><view class="chart-heading"><text>每日热量摄入趋势</text><text class="chart-period">{{trend.rangeStart}} — {{trend.rangeEnd}}</text></view><view class="chart-legend"><text class="actual-key">● 已记录</text><text>┄ 目标 {{trend.goalText}}</text></view><view class="plot-y"><text>{{overview.unit}}</text><text>{{trend.maxText}}</text></view><view class="line-plot"><view class="plot-grid grid-low"></view><view class="plot-grid grid-mid"></view><view class="plot-grid grid-high"></view><view class="target-rule" style="bottom:{{trend.goalBottom}}rpx;"></view><view class="line-segment" wx:for="{{trend.segments}}" wx:key="key" style="{{item.style}}"></view><view class="point-hit" wx:for="{{trend.points}}" wx:key="key" style="left:{{item.x}}rpx;bottom:{{item.missing ? 0 : item.y}}rpx;" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="handlePoint"><view class="plot-dot {{item.missing ? 'plot-missing' : ''}}"></view></view></view><view class="plot-labels"><text wx:for="{{trend.points}}" wx:key="key" style="left:{{item.x}}rpx;">{{item.showLabel ? item.label : ''}}</text></view><view class="chart-tooltip" wx:if="{{chartPoint}}">{{chartPoint.label}} · {{chartPoint.display}} {{overview.unit}}</view><view class="difference"><text>与目标相比 {{overview.difference}}</text><text>基于已记录日期的日均摄入</text></view><text class="chart-note">点圆点查看数值。虚线空点表示未记录，不计作零摄入。</text></view>
    <view class="dashboard-card"><view class="chart-heading"><text>三大营养素</text><text class="chart-period">基于有营养值的记录</text></view><view class="nutrition-layout"><view class="nutrition-ring" style="{{nutritionRingStyle}}"><view><view class="ring-value"><text class="ring-number">{{overview.macroDays}}</text><text class="ring-unit">天</text></view><text class="ring-label">有营养值</text></view></view><view class="nutrition-list"><view wx:for="{{overview.nutrients}}" wx:key="key" class="nutrient-row"><view class="nutrient-top"><text class="nutrient-name name-{{item.key}}">{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.grams}} g</text></view><view class="nutrient-track"><view class="fill-{{item.key}}" style="width:{{item.width}}%;"></view></view><text class="nutrient-share">{{item.share}}% 供能比</text></view></view></view><text class="chart-note">克数按有营养值的记录天数取平均；缺失营养值不参与占比。</text></view>
    <view class="dashboard-mini-row"><view class="dashboard-mini"><image src="/assets/icons/line-water.png" mode="aspectFit" /><text>饮水达标</text><view><text>{{overview.waterDays}}</text> 天 / {{rangeDays}} 天</view></view><view class="dashboard-mini"><image src="/assets/icons/card-leaf.png" mode="aspectFit" /><text>食物多样性</text><view><text>{{overview.distinct}}</text> 种</view></view></view>
    <view class="dashboard-card"><view class="chart-heading"><view class="body-trend-heading"><text>{{bodyTrendLabel}}变化</text><view class="body-history-link" bindtap="openBodyHistory" aria-role="button">查看历史记录 ›</view></view><button size="mini" class="weight-record-button" bindtap="handleOpenWeight">记变化</button></view><view class="body-trend-tabs"><view class="{{bodyTrendMetric === 'kg' ? 'body-trend-active' : ''}}" data-key="kg" bindtap="handleBodyMetric">体重</view><view class="{{bodyTrendMetric === 'waistCm' ? 'body-trend-active' : ''}}" data-key="waistCm" bindtap="handleBodyMetric">腰围</view><view class="{{bodyTrendMetric === 'hipCm' ? 'body-trend-active' : ''}}" data-key="hipCm" bindtap="handleBodyMetric">臀围</view></view><view class="weight-summary" wx:if="{{bodyTrendSummary}}">{{bodyTrendSummary}}<text>{{bodyTrendChange}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{weightGraph.points.length}}"><view class="weight-plot"><view class="weight-segment" wx:for="{{weightGraph.segments}}" wx:key="key" style="{{item.style}}"></view><view class="weight-dot" wx:for="{{weightGraph.points}}" wx:key="key" style="left:{{item.x}}rpx;bottom:{{item.y}}rpx;"></view></view><view class="weight-range"><text>{{trend.rangeStart}}</text><text>{{trend.rangeEnd}}</text></view></view><text class="chart-note" wx:else>这段时间还没有{{bodyTrendLabel}}记录，可以在这里记一次。</text></view>
    <view class="dashboard-card" wx:if="{{viewState === 'empty'}}"><text class="chart-heading">先从一餐开始</text><text class="chart-note">这个时间段还没有饮食记录，可以选择其他日期，或记下今天的一餐。</text><view class="start-record" bindtap="handleOpenAdd">去记一餐</view></view>
    <view class="dashboard-card data-explain"><view class="chart-heading" bindtap="handleDetails"><text>数据说明与更多观察</text><text>{{showDetails ? '−' : '＋'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{showDetails}}"><text class="chart-note">日历深黄色仅表示早餐、午餐和晚餐均有记录，不代表饮食完整或健康。切换日期后，图表展示截至该日的近7天或30天。水量按当时记录与当前饮水目标比较。</text><view class="detail-stats" wx:if="{{view}}"><text>平均进食窗口 {{view.behavior.windowText}}</text><text>平均第一餐 {{view.behavior.firstMealText}}</text><text>20点后有记录 {{view.behavior.lateDaysText}}</text><text>食物重复率 {{view.diversity.repeatText}}</text></view></view></view>
    <text class="trends-footnote">基于已记录数据。未记录不代表未进食，份量与营养值可能为估算。</text>
  </block><app-dock opacity="{{navOpacity}}" blur="{{navBlur}}" glass="{{navGlass}}" theme="{{uiResolvedTheme}}" active="analysis" />

  <body-editor visible="{{weightEditorOpen}}" mode="{{bodyEditorMode}}" theme="{{uiResolvedTheme}}" bindclose="closeWeightEditor" bindsaved="handleBodySaved" />
</view>
